DSA under VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1: the trainer forward calls the BI rollout's own DSA kernels (indexer, deterministic
top-k, sparse MLA with one KV split), so trainer and rollout DSA outputs are bitwise equal. Needs vllm-k31-bi-01.
Upstream status: not yet proposed.

